+| `digest_max_envelopes`               | `10`    | Maximum envelopes summarized into one digest prompt.                    |
+| `response_guidance_max_bytes`        | `512`   | Budget for per-delivery response guidance.                              |
+| `delivery_structured_body_max_bytes` | `4096`  | Maximum structured body size rendered into the delivery prompt wrapper. |
